  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The current fcrepo-camel component allows users to specify endpoints with a static fcr:transform value:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "to(\"fcrepo:localhost:8080/rest?transform=foo\")",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "or a configurable property:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "to(\"fcrepo:localhost:8080/rest?transform=",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ],
       "text": "transform",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "\")",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "but this doesn't allow for the case when that value needs to be dynamically determined while a route is running, such as by checking the indexing:hasIndexingTransform property of an object.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Instead, users should be able to dynamically configure that value in the same way they can dynamically configure the Identifier value:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "setHeader(FCREPO_TRANSFORM).xpath(\"/rdf:RDF/rdf:Description/indexing:hasIndexingTransform/text()\", ns) ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1
  },
